This is an independent, from-scratch implementation of a subset of the
CrowdSec Local API and firewall-bouncer behavior. It is **not affiliated with,
endorsed by, or sponsored by CrowdSec SAS**. "CrowdSec" is a trademark of
CrowdSec SAS and is used here only to describe interoperability.

Wire compatibility note
-----------------------
The protocols were implemented independently for compatibility. No CrowdSec
source code is included in this repository.

The upstream CrowdSec engine (https://github.com/crowdsecurity/crowdsec) and
crowdsec-firewall-bouncer (https://github.com/crowdsecurity/cs-firewall-bouncer)
